{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "15165ca7deb45c026dbf20acd9aef019aff2608653dc4d8761541b773c6d1520", "ja": "よしっ、お姉ちゃんに聞いてみようっと。\n『クリスマスの夜、空いてる？』……送信♪", "zh": "好，去问问姐姐吧。\n“圣诞节晚上有空吗？”……发送♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0a5f00853bfd89e3e63d484493ca2c9a7354aa3979908ea5d28cdfd0f617a301", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れ様です。\nクリスマスが、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。圣诞节有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "478bfd367002407cbfb8d0b872340e890d6723c584895b0feff19704da8a2f4f", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお姉ちゃんに、クリスマスの予定を聞いてたんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n我刚才在问姐姐圣诞节有什么安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "8efdf29a4db291d5343968bc3006e101b9b2af6448676ccf5063bbb535da3361", "ja": "近所の教会でゴスペルライブがあるので、\n一緒に行けたらいいなーって♪", "zh": "因为附近的教堂有福音音乐演出，要是能一起去就好了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "08d7250b9930f4a9c07c59dbdebb1bbacd710e41457cb94d385ada28643458d2", "ja": "へぇ、ゴスペルライブですか。\nクリスマスらしくて素敵ですね。", "zh": "哦，福音音乐会啊。\n很有圣诞气氛，真不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "3af7d1acc4790d9127f463fef118346e3c55e6d2528c0521f1a6dacb6566ed63", "ja": "はい。劇場でも、何かクリスマスらしいこと、\nできたらいいですよね～。", "zh": "是的。要是也能在剧场做点有圣诞气氛的活动，就好了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3024590b3f5313bfae24003d394014f1084c540c1ff4bcce0325f87f624accf0", "ja": "そうですね。クリスマス……みんなで、\nクリスマスソングを歌うとかでしょうか。", "zh": "是啊。圣诞节……大家一起唱圣诞歌之类的，怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "be2c4180054ecb7d371e8013fd9623f3ff82bf738aa7118d40cd05efbd879c94", "ja": "わぁ、楽しそうですね♪　音無先輩や\n社長さんも呼んで……ああっ、そうでした！", "zh": "哇，听起来很有意思呢♪　把音无前辈和社长也叫来……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "c987dd9308a6094ca214be0e53de6f0c3106c456b0bc80d88eb23bf11a89ad85", "ja": "そのクリスマス公演のことで、社長さんが\n{$P$}さんにお話があるそうです！", "zh": "听说社长有关于那场圣诞公演的事情要和{$P$}先生谈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4917a9e01306a7a807cc1569db929685d8317ae61a01f51d2044675886b7b9ef", "ja": "わかりました、ありがとうございます！\n早速、行ってきますね。", "zh": "明白了，谢谢你！\n我这就过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "c830cedaedf2daf8c0b6821cbca09c4797ea0f13a1476695e246ca9c460f9ec3", "ja": "はーい、お気をつけて～！\nいってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好～的，路上小心哦～！\n慢走呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5ad5add17e94f109c66e8a83ea81c4fbd0d4aeb1106da2e60c7e7907adeef2a6", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れ様です！", "zh": "社长、音无小姐，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "df9efa9956baff4c7d3de92e91242cf47a54ea9d4f91c617c1be5e36d2be4ca9", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん。\nお待ちしてまし……くしゅんっ！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n我等您等得……阿嚏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3db1f3760b5fbe3ed0a34371a5b4674c758c774e5489bc9eaca129c9fac220c7", "ja": "だ、大丈夫ですか、音無さん？\n風邪でも引いたんじゃ……？", "zh": "没、没事吧，音无小姐？\n该不会是感冒了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "ceb27073350c073fc9a28a18fc0139b66c6bddf433052ee2aede68d56d8e4cc4", "ja": "いえ、風邪ではないんです！　さっきまで、\n換気のために窓を開けていたので……くしゅっ。", "zh": "不，不是感冒！刚才为了通风一直开着窗……阿嚏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "4a3feeb458bc4222760fff2d7a88c8b4742c5c6166dab718ab14e37f2ecd0435", "ja": "けど、こんなにくしゃみが出るなんて……\nもしかしたら、誰かが私のことをウワサして……！？", "zh": "可是，居然打了这么多喷嚏……\n难道是有人在议论我……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "36de020430443eaf6c2826839c7de6ac143a9334c7435cde442ca6fcab96aab1", "ja": "そうでしたか。風邪じゃないなら、よかったです。\nところで社長、お話があると聞いたんですが……。", "zh": "原来是这样。不是感冒就好。对了，社长，我听说您有事要跟我谈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "ece387260df1b04e3a5f0bf144dca6232423dc06418614d8dadd63513943fcdc", "ja": "おお、そうだった。\nCLEVER CLOVERの公演のことなんだが……。", "zh": "哦，对了。\n是关于CLEVER CLOVER公演的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "9f46d78cd4d873f38bd12ef9a00ee4c89f1becbb7ffa48e99e0e718f62e192a1", "ja": "星梨花君たちの新曲、独創的なダンスが、\nとても好評だと聞いているよ。君もご苦労だったね！", "zh": "星梨花她们的新歌和独创的舞蹈，听说都大受好评。你也辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "251a1dd91a571d17366b075fb558b87635d36edb68ca875682211eb1b4318b93", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nアイドル達が頑張ってくれたおかげです。", "zh": "谢谢您！\n多亏偶像们努力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "ffa89c98939c5ec03693beadda04a7e4107804ef67b382b01735d5750368150c", "ja": "うむ！　この勢いで、次の曲も\n君に任せたいと思っているんだが、どうかね？", "zh": "嗯！我想趁着这股势头，把下一首歌\n也交给你来负责，你意下如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "66ff889fbd1ff7cd8ccfb9ab49aabfaa1fe4a19fe829abe3496209f72b9a28d0", "ja": "はい！　ぜひ、やらせてください！\n必ず、いい公演にしてみせます！", "zh": "好的！请务必让我来做！\n我一定会努力把演出办好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "5361a688b24d050e8790cbd02619695cf13fdf34804f05784380bfef4c224646", "ja": "いい返事だ！　それで新曲なんだが、せっかくだし、\nクリスマスソングがいいんじゃないかと思ってね。", "zh": "这回答不错！至于新歌，难得有这个机会，我觉得还是圣诞歌曲比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8a6342e03d6622ea8f3a0f587d05c0e77afcb482c8de0e66a04f31ff56781ed7", "ja": "奇遇ですね！　俺も同じ事を考えていました。\nそれに、北東エリアの雰囲気にもピッタリですし……。", "zh": "真巧啊！我也在想同样的事。\n而且也很符合东北区域的氛围……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "41e5727127c5e876da3c857dcdc08e6be6ed0f0d11bd4c768f7532d7c78f82cd", "ja": "せっかくなので、みんなで歌えるような……\nそんなクリスマスソングがいいと思うんですが。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，我觉得还是选一首能让大家一起唱的……\n这样的圣诞歌曲比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "694dad853edeb901bbda2fbfb399f6f09365f725c7e7fdb0adc03dae7a2a5450", "ja": "アイドルのみんなと歌う、クリスマスソング……\n想像するだけで、ワクワクしてきますね♪", "zh": "和偶像们一起唱的圣诞歌……\n光是想象一下，就让人兴奋起来了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "365d08078fa9b1f7983ba7c62d3a7c2142b5626fc48c20a4f791090b1b9fc857", "ja": "どうやら満場一致のようだね。\nでは、後のことはすべて君に任せよう！", "zh": "看来大家似乎一致同意了。\n那么，之后的一切就全交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "eca7f05e75d28f80ba4329edfc7c24cfe827fbb9d7c1036d18738bd3a279a3a4", "ja": "クリスマスを彩る素晴らしい公演、期待しているよ！", "zh": "期待着为圣诞节增色添彩的精彩演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0efacb31c06841bd0cb992d69ce6ce1f4d728eb8223c5399f8ca737e1954f488", "ja": "はい！　期待に応えられるよう、\n頑張ります！", "zh": "好的！为了不辜负您的期待，\n我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "934c11fccf3f7d9dcda5f072e3e0c8a9798eb13e681ddbf267152b7004c2310d", "ja": "（みんなで歌うクリスマス……きっと\n思い出に残る、そんな公演になるはずだ！）", "zh": "（大家一起唱歌的圣诞节……一定会成为一场令人难忘的演出！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
